  "steps": {
    "_note": "Footfalls. A footstep is the moment a foot plants in the walk or run clip (seconds at playback 1.0, left then right; data/combat/fx.json scale_sets.<set>.footfalls_s). The shake and dust ids come from fx.json scale_sets. min_speed_mps: below it she is standing, not stepping.",
